# PR new hunks — what changed since the last review concluded

Last reviewed head: db9f89c6df63428ebabd61ce15db7a8d8cd5e211
Current head: aa58a9c8258d1f3b63bc5043f361c9f02c1ade4e

These hunks are the re-review scope, together with their interaction
neighborhood (direct callers/callees of changed symbols). Every line
NOT shown here is frozen: a finding on an unchanged line must show that
these hunks make the problem worse (the interaction test) — otherwise
it is advisory digest only, never a review thread.

--- diff ---

# pr_new_hunks.txt Truncated

Original size: 152182 characters.
Kept: first 7800 and last 4200 characters.

The full diff is available in the checked-out PR branch. Use `git diff` or CodeGraph for focused source navigation instead of relying only on this file.

```diff
diff --git a/.pubignore b/.pubignore
index b647405141..902b4d1e65 100644
--- a/.pubignore
+++ b/.pubignore
@@ -26,9 +26,12 @@
 /fa-local/
 /coverage/

-# Vendored forks: only the xterm dev-dependency ships (pubspec dev_deps).
+# Vendored forks: only the xterm + pty2 dev-dependencies ship (pubspec
+# dev_deps). pty2 is the gh-2208 patched fork (pid getter) — staged like
+# xterm so the publish payload resolves the same sources (CI run 43851264755).
 /vendor/*
 !/vendor/xterm/
+!/vendor/pty2/

 # Local packages: only the fa_llm_mock dev-dependency ships.
 /packages/*
